WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:15.455
Robot went back to Hope's room.

2
00:00:15.456 --> 00:00:29.295
He waited for Hope's bedtime.

3
00:00:29.296 --> 00:00:31.353
Then he made a wish.

4
00:00:31.354 --> 00:00:36.449
"I want to be a hero like MechaTron."

5
00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:38.531
Robot looked around.

6
00:00:38.532 --> 00:00:41.767
"Now how can I find that fairy?"

7
00:00:41.768 --> 00:00:45.711
Noly was behind him. "You could—"

8
00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:50.876
"Ugh!" Robot snapped. "Stop following me!"

9
00:00:50.877 --> 00:00:54.808
The moon shone brightly through the window.

10
00:00:54.809 --> 00:01:00.499
"Horse tells stories about fairy dust and moonlight," Robot said.

11
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:06.241
"And Rabbit dreamed he hopped to the moon.

12
00:01:06.242 --> 00:01:12.648
Maybe the fairy lives on the moon."

13
00:01:12.649 --> 00:01:15.665
Robot grabbed some building pieces.

14
00:01:15.666 --> 00:01:18.525
"I'll build a ladder to the moon."

15
00:01:18.526 --> 00:01:23.733
"Yeah!" Noly said. "That's what a hero would do!"

16
00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:32.235
Robot growled. "MechaTron could just fly there."

17
00:01:32.236 --> 00:01:35.268
Robot began putting pieces together.

18
00:01:35.269 --> 00:01:38.073
"Here's a good piece," Noly said.

19
00:01:38.074 --> 00:01:42.110
Bump! She knocked into the ladder.

20
00:01:42.111 --> 00:01:46.274
"You clumsy dinosaur!" Robot snapped.

21
00:01:46.275 --> 00:01:55.481
"I'm sorry!" Noly said.

22
00:01:55.482 --> 00:01:59.962
Robot built the ladder again.

23
00:01:59.963 --> 00:02:02.927
He made it taller and taller.

24
00:02:02.928 --> 00:02:12.333
But it barely reached the windowsill.

25
00:02:12.334 --> 00:02:17.176
Robot climbed to the top anyway.

26
00:02:17.177 --> 00:02:20.347
"The moon is still far away.

27
00:02:20.348 --> 00:02:25.583
The ladder isn't tall enough!"

28
00:02:25.584 --> 00:02:29.612
"You'll think of something else," Noly said.

29
00:02:29.613 --> 00:02:38.397
Robot paced around the room for a long time.

30
00:02:38.398 --> 00:02:41.791
He saw the light box toy.

31
00:02:41.792 --> 00:02:46.454
"Horse said that fairy magic glows," Robot said.

32
00:02:46.455 --> 00:02:49.720
"Maybe . . ."

33
00:02:49.721 --> 00:02:52.945
Robot ran to the light box.

34
00:02:52.946 --> 00:02:58.380
He picked up some tiny pegs.

35
00:02:58.381 --> 00:03:02.863
Noly watched him. "Are you writing a message?

36
00:03:02.864 --> 00:03:04.849
What does it say?"

37
00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:07.455
Robot read it aloud.

38
00:03:07.456 --> 00:03:14.558
"'To the fairy: Come now!'"

39
00:03:14.559 --> 00:03:21.504
"Cool," Noly said. "She'll see that for sure."

40
00:03:21.505 --> 00:03:33.169
"Go to sleep," Robot snapped.

41
00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:36.743
Robot watched and waited.

42
00:03:36.744 --> 00:03:42.424
But no fairy came.

